    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Nys nanwiht unrihtlycre ðonne ys þæt man medsceattas onfó for domum: for ðan þe ða medsceattas ablendað þæra wisra manna heortan 7 hi forcyrrað ðæra rihtwisra manna word.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Nothing is more unjust than one who accepts bribes for his judgements, because the bribes blind a wise man’s heart, and they subvert the words of the more righteous man.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et nichil iniustius est quam susceptio munerum pro iudicio subuertendo, quia munera excecant cor sapientum et subuertunt uerba iustorum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
